---
import { cvtPath } from "../../lib/site";
import { isSuperhumanTheme } from "../../lib/cvt-theme";
---

{
 isSuperhumanTheme ? (
 <section class="sh-section sh-section--muted scroll-mt-20">
 <div class="sh-section__inner">
 <p class="sh-eyebrow">Vision</p>
 <h2 class="sh-display-xl">Trust that travels with you</h2>
 <p class="sh-lead max-w-3xl">
 Much of Uganda’s economy runs on relationships, referrals and reputation - trust that is real but hard to carry beyond a stage, SACCO or neighbourhood. CVT turns verified facts into portable standing for service providers, starting with commercial transport.
 </p>
 <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-base text-[#4a4768]">
 Transport is not our business. <strong class="text-[#1b1938]">Trust, visibility and accountability are.</strong>
 </p>
 <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
 <a href={cvtPath("vision")} class="sh-btn-primary">Read the full vision →</a>
 <a href={cvtPath("map")} class="sh-btn-outline">Project map</a>
 </div>
 </div>
 </section>
 ) : (
 <section class="section-band section-divider border-t border-hairline bg-canvas-soft/20">
 <p class="map-kicker">Vision</p>
 <h2 class="display-md">Trust that travels with you</h2>
 <p class="map-lead mt-4 max-w-2xl">
 Much of Uganda’s economy runs on relationships and reputation that do not travel. CVT builds portable standing from verified facts - starting with commercial transport, aimed at service providers across informal economies.
 </p>
 <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-body">
 Transport is not our business. <strong class="text-ink-strong">Trust, visibility and accountability are.</strong>
 </p>
 <p class="mt-6">
 <a href={cvtPath("vision")} class="btn-outline !text-sm">Read the full vision →</a>
 </p>
 </section>
 )
}
